      "title": "Not Yet in Bloom",
      "text": "The garden does not keep a clock.\nOne flower opens; others wait.\nBeneath the soil, a quiet root\ncan grow without a single cheer.\n\nI need not race the morning light\nor borrow someone else's spring.\nMy steady effort has a place.\nNot yet in bloom is still alive.",
